WHEN TO USE FALLBACK
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

🔄 Retry with fallback when:
   • Validation fails after clarification
   • Implementation throws exception
   • Skills/rules conflict detected mid-execution
   • Timeout or resource exhaustion

🚫 DON'T retry (report immediately):
   • Security vulnerability detected
   • Authentication failure (wrong credentials context)
   • User explicitly cancelled
   • Invalid request after clarification
